  <item>
    <title>打鱼晒网 007 ：世界人民逛跳蚤市场</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/634ff53f2a992d56e91e6236</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">634ff53f2a992d56e91e6236</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 19 Oct 2022 13:01:50 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>内容简介</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>本期是猫助和两位客座主播，一起在多抓鱼南京小小避难所的活动现场录制的特别节目。客座主播分别是：来自《博物志》的婉莹，和来自《世界莫名其妙物语》的见师。</span></p><span></span><p><span>你喜欢逛跳蚤市场吗？跳蚤市场、古玩市集、白象拍卖、车库大甩卖都是些啥？只敢趁月黑风高出摊儿的鬼市上到底卖了什么见不得人的东西？在大街上捡垃圾会捡到什么好东西，又会踩到什么雷？在craigslist等二手平台上买卖东西要注意哪些问题？主播们在世界各地都逛了哪些跳蚤市场、上面能买到什么好东西？哪个市场附赠卡拉OK服务，哪个归根结底就是北京动物园儿？三位主播一起逛过的鹤岗早市上有什么了不起的东西？二手商品的跨国倒爷们都是怎么挣钱的？多抓鱼最早的团建竟然是这样的活动……？详情请收听本期节目！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主播</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>来自《博物志》的婉莹 &nbsp;| 来自世妙的见师 | 来自多抓鱼的猫助</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>音乐</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>开场背景音乐：胡伟立《市集》</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目的OP：帮主播一起摆摊的虫宝 | 小光头为什么没有头发</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目的ED：婉莹现场演唱的《窗外》</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lrLTCbBcTwcWhEukT4gc0bvGdfnB.m4a" length="80596987" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:27:44</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0Zrakk2SjJnVGsxdmdYSEJWckZ5NjBKNlM2eS0ucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>打鱼晒网 006：你知道我这五年是怎么过的吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62ff4742fcc897b6fbe48a83</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">62ff4742fcc897b6fbe48a83</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 19 Aug 2022 08:18:10 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>五年……你知道我这五年是怎么过的吗？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>一起来听听朋友们写给多抓鱼的来信，以及鱼编的回信。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>📮✉️</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>第一封信</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="79">01:19</a> &nbsp;来信：想去新疆的朋友</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="375">06:15</a></span><strong><span> </span></strong><span>回信：来自新疆的DJ</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>第二封信</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="555">09:15</a> 来信：尿毒症患者</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="652">10:52</a> 回信：肿瘤患者</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>第三封信</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="831">13:51</a> 来信：要带娃的中年爸爸</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1098">18:18</a> 回信：多抓鱼唯一一位妈妈</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>第四封信</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1359">22:39</a> 来信：某离异女士</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1512">25:12</a> 回信： 某鱼编</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>第五封信</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1753">29:13</a> 来信：电子厂厂工</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2204">36:44</a> 回信：昆山仓小李</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>第六封信</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2832">47:12</a> 来信：成都大学生（四川话版）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3134">52:14</a> 回信：天津仓玉擎</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>🎵 本期音乐</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>岛 - IZ乐队</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Lonely God - 惘闻</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>教我如何去小便（《麦兜菠萝油王子》）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>悠悠的风（《麦兜菠萝油王子》）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>旅途愉快 - 寸铁</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>我只是一个驾训班教练（《阳光普照》）- 林生祥</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Don’t Forget - Jim Hall / Pat Metheny</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>杀死那个石家庄人 - 万能青年旅店</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>晚上好，春天小姐 - 五条人</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqrS6UwDhIcHOEfC9o_vGOKQ_x8M.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>正负人生——多抓鱼五周年通信展</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>⏰ 时间：7/30 - 8/31</span></p><span></span><p><span>🏠 地点：北京三里屯 · 多抓鱼循环商店</span></p>]]></description>
