  <item>
    <title>打鱼晒网 005：多抓鱼五周年茶话会</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62ff45242427ab3f84afac27</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">62ff45242427ab3f84afac27</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 19 Aug 2022 08:09:02 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>多抓鱼上线五周年之际，我们做了一次通信活动，本期播客既是多抓鱼女子茶话会也是给大家的回信。</span></p><span></span><p><span>无论是新问题，还是老问题，听完也许都不再是什么大问题！</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>Shownotes</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><strong><span>五周年树洞</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="24">00:24</a> </span></strong><span>收到了五百封来信，年轻人的烦恼竟如此相通</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="189">03:09</a></span></strong><span> 读信｜来信中那些不曾预想和经历过的苦痛</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>大家的 25 岁</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="976">16:16</a> </span></strong><span>猫助：无业游荡的日子，在公园长椅上顿悟了：欲望很重要！</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1279">21:19</a> </span></strong><span>喂鹿：逃离山东人厅里厅气的宿命，但不知道怎么寻找路径</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1548">25:48</a> </span></strong><span>李婵：不想去戒毒所做一眼望到头的工作，但又进了另一种戒毒所</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>闲话多抓鱼「相亲局」</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1871">31:11</a> </span></strong><span>李婵：加入一家日活为 5、其中 3 个都是员工的「皮包公司」</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1995">33:15</a> </span></strong><span>喂鹿：去上海找猫助求职，结果猫助回屋里睡着了</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>抗 YI ！</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2209">36:49</a> </span></strong><span>被封一个月的一层：焊铁板的电光树影，越美丽越心碎</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2310">38:30</a> </span></strong><span>被封三个月的李婵 &amp; 从北京回上海的猫助：尽管如此，我们还是不想离开上海</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2563">42:43</a> </span></strong><span>带着孩子被集中隔离的喂鹿：个体有错吗？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2760">46:00</a> 《纽伦堡审判》的启示</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>新问题和老问题</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3001">50:01</a> </span></strong><span>信息越来越透明，路径和新创造却越来越少</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3365">56:05</a></span></strong><span> 疫情之后，外部问题转向内部问题：个体的内心饱受摧残</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3449">57:29</a> </span></strong><span>总要面临选择，但不要陷于选择的陷阱</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3627">60:27</a> </span></strong><span>30？40？年龄节点的阵痛</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3937">65:37</a> </span></strong><span>又回到一眼看到边界的生活怪圈里</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4069">67:49</a> </span></strong><span>当你凝视命运的时候，你就比命运更伟大</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqrS6UwDhIcHOEfC9o_vGOKQ_x8M.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>正负人生——多抓鱼五周年通信展</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>⏰ 时间：7/30 - 8/31</span></p><span></span><p><span>🏠 地点：北京三里屯·多抓鱼循环商店</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lsZ82j5q6czViqDMJUPfkzlZeeb_.m4a" length="67700676" type="audio/mp4"/>
