    <itunes:duration>00:52:08</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqUiZjGt5CPr8c-87VK6R_wmdEgE.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>打鱼晒网 002 ：穿优衣库算时髦吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/60c0d5b1dbed1678a5ccabd2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">60c0d5b1dbed1678a5ccabd2</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 09 Jun 2021 14:51:17 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>每个人都要穿衣服。</span></p><span></span><p><span>什么样的衣服是美，什么样的衣服是丑，又是什么铸就了一个时代的流行？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目里刚刚涉足二手时装领域的猫助，和从 90 年代就开始做服装设计的张达两位忘年之友进行了一番毫不严谨的真实探讨。</span></p><span></span><p><span>其间夹杂各种趣闻及八卦，通俗易懂，但不可当真。欢迎工作学习通勤泡澡时三心二意地收听。</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>shownotes：</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="90">1:30</a> 服装设计和绘画的区别，以及服装设计到底算不算艺术？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">5:00</a> 到底怎么定义「设计师品牌」？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">8:00</a> 服装的定价都是怎么来的，为什么有的设计师服装可以定那么贵呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="620">10:20</a> 很少的品牌可以穿越周期，为什么服装品牌总是倒闭？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="920">15:20</a> 小时候步行街上那些现在看起来很奇怪的山寨服装是怎么来的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1320">22:00</a> 什么是流行？什么是好看？为什么有些风格（例如军旅风）突然不流行了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1620">27:00</a> 线上和线下好卖服装的区别: 线上卖的是图片而不是衣服</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1980">33:00</a> 什么人会买二手的优衣库？</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FnXRBAewEz8-mCT01O3SHHQ4FVVJ.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>每个人都要穿的 T 恤</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2280">38:00</a> 看图说话环节：什么衣服在二手市场卖得好？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2535">42:15</a> &nbsp;为什么现在的流行低幼风？</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FpXzq_ac2tKHumxa8hLYF8l-SxHM.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>SHUSHU/TONG 粉色泡泡袖上衣</span></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/Fpu-5MCK8MU5Xd07HSq8aFYD_wCd.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>TYAKASHA 短袖衬衫</span></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2790">46:30</a> 店里一件一天被一百个人看上的马甲是：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image-qiniu.jellow.site/FmxOBQYxQ9A5NSYxaeHOnroLugl0.jpeg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2970">49:30</a> 奥特莱斯专卖的大品牌副线的前世今生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3240">54:00</a> 互吹时间</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头曲：《名 字 都 说 错》 -- sususu</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾曲：《词不达意你也懂》-- sususu</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lq9PZjtszcJiT32UydsFzop8FIB-.mp3" length="82784031" type="audio/mpeg"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:57:28</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr_ZUGHlVH1CTnXf7VR8-UMOw7wl.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>打鱼晒网 001 ：新书首发 | 我想成为噩梦世界的居民</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/60a25137c865646fd1658ea1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">60a25137c865646fd1658ea1</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 17 May 2021 11:17:27 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>多抓鱼的渔民们会「三天打鱼、两天晒网」地更新。推荐图书、好物，或者随便聊聊。第一期我们想推荐一本能给人带来眩晕感的漫画——《梦晕》。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期嘉宾：猫助、铁雄、hayashi、上青</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.duozhuayu.com/books/548163257039458860" data-url="https://www.duozhuayu.com/books/548163257039458860"><span>《梦晕》购买链接</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间轴</span></strong></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="100">01:40</a></span></code><span> -</span><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">7:00</a></span></code><span> 「藤本理是谁？」</span></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="420">7:00</a></span></code><span>-</span><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a></span></code><span> 「《梦晕》让做梦和不做梦的人都产生了眩晕」</span></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a></span></code><span>-</span><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2220">37:00</a></span></code><span> 「猫助对现实世界的不真实感」</span></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2280">38:00</a></span></code><span>- </span><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2760">46:00</a></span></code><span>「原来白日梦是真实存在的？ v.s. 原来不是人人都会做白日梦？」</span></p><span></span><p><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2940">49:00</a></span></code><span>- </span><code><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3300">55:00</a></span></code><span> 「藤本理的漫画里为什么有这么多动物形象？」</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期音乐：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Sleepwalker - Arcade Fire</span></p><span></span><p><span>Daydreaming - Radiohead</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/t_lo6nbTIKZUhcaoIRapG0h3kUiiPO.m4a" length="46473345" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:55:50</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZyX1pVR0hsVkgxQ1RuWGY3VlI4LVVNT3c3d2wucG5n.png"/>
